WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.121 --> 00:00:14.730
The girls never lacked ideas about how to keep themselves entertained at home.

2
00:00:16.011 --> 00:00:19.073
And having a piano in the house only added to the fun.

3
00:00:19.093 --> 00:00:22.155
"Beth, can you play this one next?"

4
00:00:22.856 --> 00:00:26.098
Amy asked about an old folk song she had liked as a little girl.

5
00:00:26.118 --> 00:00:31.454
"It reminds me of my childhood," the 12-year-old girl recalled fondly.

6
00:00:32.675 --> 00:00:39.900
Mother turned away, hiding a smile, while Jo rolled her eyes and said in a teasing tone, "And

7
00:00:40.020 --> 00:00:45.124
now that you are so old, you want to relive the days of your youth, do you?"

8
00:00:45.144 --> 00:00:50.608
"You don't know how hard my life is right now," Amy started to protest.

9
00:00:51.489 --> 00:00:55.892
Before a quarrel could start, Beth hastily began playing Amy's request.

10
00:01:00.188 --> 00:01:01.569
It was true what Amy said.

11
00:01:02.670 --> 00:01:06.432
School had changed quite a bit since her older sisters had attended.

12
00:01:07.272 --> 00:01:11.855
Nowadays, girls Amy's age were more outspoken, bold, and daring.

13
00:01:12.835 --> 00:01:17.598
As a result, some girls pressured others to do things they would not normally do.

14
00:01:18.379 --> 00:01:24.482
Wanting to please and be accepted, sometimes they gave in to the pressure, as Amy did today.

15
00:01:25.423 --> 00:01:31.066
The day started off like any other day: Meg and Jo were running late as usual, thanks to

16
00:01:31.106 --> 00:01:34.548
Jo. Beth was dressed and ready to leave for Mr.

17
00:01:34.568 --> 00:01:40.272
Laurence's. Mother and Hannah had faithfully prepared everyone's breakfast and packed Amy's lunch.

18
00:01:41.173 --> 00:01:43.795
Amy, on the other hand, was unusually quiet.

19
00:01:44.655 --> 00:01:49.839
Noticing her sister's odd behavior, Meg asked, "Is there something the matter, Amy?"

20
00:01:50.899 --> 00:01:57.744
Dramatically shaking her head, Amy sighed, then lamented, "Yes, there is."

21
00:01:58.760 --> 00:02:00.101
"Won't you tell me what it is?"

22
00:02:00.602 --> 00:02:07.007
Meg further inquired, keeping one eye on Jo, who had come downstairs just a second earlier but then

23
00:02:07.088 --> 00:02:09.329
stomped back up muttering under her breath.

24
00:02:10.430 --> 00:02:17.357
Amy brushed her golden curls, lowered her eyes, and said in a soft, pitiful voice, "Today is my

25
00:02:17.417 --> 00:02:21.260
turn to buy limes for the girls but I haven't got any money."

26
00:02:21.280 --> 00:02:24.062
"Limes? What for?"

27
00:02:24.403 --> 00:02:25.544
Meg asked, surprised.

28
00:02:26.608 --> 00:02:34.532
"Well, Christina, Katy, Mary, and Julia Amy named the most popular girls in her school and continued, started

29
00:02:34.572 --> 00:02:35.892
the most marvelous game.

30
00:02:36.953 --> 00:02:41.174
Each week a girl buys a bag of limes and gives one to her true friends.

31
00:02:42.275 --> 00:02:45.776
If you are given a lime, that means that you are considered a friend.

32
00:02:46.617 --> 00:02:48.958
And the girls have all been so kind to me.

33
00:02:48.978 --> 00:02:51.759
I never knew I had so many friends!"

34
00:02:52.539 --> 00:02:53.900
Amy cried modestly.

35
00:02:55.344 --> 00:02:59.107
"So today you are the one handing out the limes," Meg stated.

36
00:02:59.927 --> 00:03:02.749
Nodding, Amy exclaimed, "Oh, dearest Meg!

37
00:03:03.070 --> 00:03:04.130
Could you help me out?

38
00:03:04.771 --> 00:03:06.032
I don't even have a penny!

39
00:03:06.732 --> 00:03:09.895
What will the girls think if I don't have any limes to give them?"

40
00:03:10.815 --> 00:03:14.518
Sweet understanding Meg merely opened her purse and took out a quarter.

41
00:03:14.538 --> 00:03:18.361
(Now back in those days, a quarter was worth a lot of money!

42
00:03:19.281 --> 00:03:21.943
Just see how many limes Amy could buy with 25 cents!)

43
00:03:23.940 --> 00:03:24.580
"Thank you!"

44
00:03:24.981 --> 00:03:28.042
squealed Amy, jumping up and down and hugging her sister.

45
00:03:28.062 --> 00:03:33.444
"A quarter will get me a bag of 25, maybe 26, if Mr.

46
00:03:33.484 --> 00:03:34.865
Peters gives me an extra.

47
00:03:35.405 --> 00:03:37.306
The girls will be so pleased!"

48
00:03:37.886 --> 00:03:44.449
Yelling her loud good-byes cheerfully to everyone, Amy dashed out the door, clutching the quarter tightly in her

49
00:03:44.509 --> 00:03:48.191
hand. "What's made her so happy all of a sudden?"

50
00:03:48.551 --> 00:03:50.952
barked Jo, taking two stairs at a time.

51
00:03:52.604 --> 00:03:57.128
"I'll tell you on the way," Meg smiled as she and Jo also left the house.

52
00:03:58.069 --> 00:04:01.051
Before going to school, Amy raced over to Mr.

53
00:04:01.091 --> 00:04:04.274
Peter's, the grocer, and bought a big bag of limes.

54
00:04:05.295 --> 00:04:07.937
As Amy had hoped, he included one extra.

55
00:04:09.298 --> 00:04:14.783
Carrying the limes to school made Amy feel powerful, since she could choose who would be her friend

56
00:04:15.023 --> 00:04:15.404
or not.

57
00:04:16.364 --> 00:04:22.953
Holding her head up high and proud, Amy walked into her classroom, deliberately rustling the paper bag so

58
00:04:22.993 --> 00:04:25.514
the sound would attract the ears of the other girls.

59
00:04:26.914 --> 00:04:33.776
As she expected, some girls ran over to her at once, complimenting her hair, her outfit, and anything

60
00:04:33.856 --> 00:04:34.817
else they could think of.

61
00:04:34.837 --> 00:04:38.378
"Amy! Your hair looks so soft today!"

62
00:04:38.658 --> 00:04:39.598
shrieked one girl.

63
00:04:39.618 --> 00:04:42.019
"Where did you get that dress?

64
00:04:42.519 --> 00:04:44.100
I want the exact same one!"

65
00:04:44.360 --> 00:04:45.140
cried another.

66
00:04:46.564 --> 00:04:52.207
Soon Amy was surrounded by most of her classmates, each one trying to get a lime to prove

67
00:04:52.247 --> 00:04:53.128
they were her friend.

68
00:04:53.148 --> 00:04:56.229
"Amy? Is that you?"

69
00:04:56.710 --> 00:05:00.772
asked a girl who walked over, wearing a pretty pink dress and matching ribbon.

70
00:05:02.073 --> 00:05:03.994
The crowd moved to make room for her.

71
00:05:05.054 --> 00:05:07.736
She glided lightly across and stood before Amy.

72
00:05:07.756 --> 00:05:14.500
"Hello, Mary," Amy said cheerfully as she opened her bag and chose a plump shiny green lime to

73
00:05:14.540 --> 00:05:14.980
give to her.

74
00:05:15.824 --> 00:05:20.646
Accepting the lime with just a smile and nod, Mary glided past Amy and went to her desk.

75
00:05:22.827 --> 00:05:23.267
"Hi, Amy!

76
00:05:23.627 --> 00:05:24.588
What's in the bag?"

77
00:05:25.028 --> 00:05:28.189
asked another girl walking over, wearing a green and white dress.

78
00:05:29.630 --> 00:05:34.192
It was Jenny, who had handed out limes last week, but didn't give one to Amy.

79
00:05:34.212 --> 00:05:36.953
"How cheeky!

80
00:05:37.313 --> 00:05:40.154
She knows what I have," Amy thought to herself.

81
00:05:41.355 --> 00:05:46.997
Aloud she smiled and said in an extra sweet voice, "Oh, it's nothing special."

82
00:05:48.158 --> 00:05:54.440
Jenny's eyes flashed and she was about to say something nasty when Kitty, Amy's best friend, grabbed her

83
00:05:54.540 --> 00:05:56.121
arm and said, "He's coming!"

84
00:05:57.101 --> 00:05:58.742
The girls scattered to their seats.

85
00:05:59.882 --> 00:06:04.344
Amy shoved the bag of limes into her desk and sat up straight, trying to look innocent.

86
00:06:05.524 --> 00:06:11.807
Mr. Davis, the teacher, a thin, balding man in his thirties, had only one complaint in life: that

87
00:06:11.847 --> 00:06:13.848
he was teaching a class of girls.

88
00:06:14.984 --> 00:06:16.265
With boys, all Mr.

89
00:06:16.305 --> 00:06:21.567
Davis needed to do was lift his stick, furrow his eyebrows and frown, and the class would do

90
00:06:21.727 --> 00:06:22.988
just as he instructed.

91
00:06:24.088 --> 00:06:25.429
With girls, Mr.

92
00:06:25.469 --> 00:06:27.970
Davis quickly learned, it was very different.

93
00:06:28.991 --> 00:06:34.533
Many tears, tantrums, and frequent silent treatments resulted if he tried to discipline them in any way.

94
00:06:35.674 --> 00:06:36.694
Still, Mr.

95
00:06:36.714 --> 00:06:39.976
Davis was very strict and stuck to his methods no matter what.

96
00:06:41.032 --> 00:06:45.316
That should have warned the girls since he had made it clear from the beginning that they were

97
00:06:45.376 --> 00:06:47.158
not to bring any limes to school.

98
00:06:47.178 --> 00:06:49.780
"Good morning, class," Mr.

99
00:06:49.820 --> 00:06:52.682
Davis greeted the girls in his usual mechanical way.

100
00:06:52.702 --> 00:06:59.668
"We have a quiz this morning and I expect all of you to His speech was interrupted by

101
00:06:59.709 --> 00:07:02.511
Jenny, who frantically waved her hand in the air.

102
00:07:03.412 --> 00:07:04.132
Frowning, Mr.

103
00:07:04.172 --> 00:07:05.894
Davis asked, "Yes, Jenny?"

104
00:07:05.914 --> 00:07:13.821
"Mr. Davis, I have an allergy and I think someone here has what I'm allergic to," she said

105
00:07:13.861 --> 00:07:14.982
in an innocent voice.

106
00:07:15.002 --> 00:07:17.044
"What would that be?"

107
00:07:17.404 --> 00:07:18.425
Mr. Davis sighed.

108
00:07:18.445 --> 00:07:24.010
"Lemons she paused then continued, and limes."

109
00:07:25.811 --> 00:07:27.312
Everyone gasped loudly.

110
00:07:28.493 --> 00:07:31.316
Amy felt her cheeks burn and her heart pump loudly.

111
00:07:32.244 --> 00:07:37.447
Mr. Davis did not say anything at first, but after what seemed like forever, he spoke in a

112
00:07:37.527 --> 00:07:39.008
calm but threatening tone.

113
00:07:39.028 --> 00:07:42.430
"Who has brought limes to school?

114
00:07:43.410 --> 00:07:46.412
Who has deliberately broken my rule?"

115
00:07:47.453 --> 00:07:50.854
Mr. Davis slapped his thin stick against the palm of his hand.

116
00:07:51.935 --> 00:07:56.498
No one dared to speak, because everyone, including Amy, knew that Mr.

117
00:07:56.538 --> 00:08:00.280
Davis would surely use that stick on anyone who broke his rules.
